+ * BRIDGE_TYPE 0 parses an outer tag by its TPID (C mode); a port with no
+ * default VID, no tag filter and XLT_MISS_FWD_CMD 0 forwards a frame no XLT
+ * rule matches unchanged. Only read: this driver leaves them at reset.
